  <Item id="9afcf75a-6b3f-53cb-a841-aa3a3b2c5dfa" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">4. Verification independence (ISO 25119-1, Table 1)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>The highest AgPLr in this project is d; the applicable degrees of independence and their assignment:</Paragraph>
        <Table><Column width="190.00"/><Column width="200.00"/><Column width="120.00"/><Column width="130.00"/><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Verification measure</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">AgPL d chain (this project)</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Independence</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Performed by</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of HARA</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>H. Larsen (systems)</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of safety plan</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required from AgPL c</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>H. Larsen</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of safety requirements</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required from AgPL b</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>T. Kowal (V&amp;V)</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of V&amp;V plan</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required from AgPL c</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>G. Hoffmann</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of safety analyses (FMEA, FTA)</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required from AgPL b/d</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>T. Kowal</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Review of safety tests + scope</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required from AgPL c/d</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U2</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>G. Hoffmann</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Safety audit</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>required at AgPL d</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text bold="true">U3</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>G. Hoffmann (independent)</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row></Table>
        <Paragraph>U1 = another person, U2 = another team, U3 = another department / third party.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="ID">
      <Value>PTO-PLN-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Responsible">
      <Value>G. Hoffmann</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Due" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="2" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ea5a5a46-edee-5ff5-8819-cd44a08b39fb" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">5. Tailoring</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>No life-cycle phase is omitted. Production planning activities (Part 1 Clause 9) are executed by the Zaragoza plant under its IATF 16949 system; the plan references their work products instead of duplicating them. Software phases follow the SRL 2 method selection recorded in the SW safety requirements specification; no scaled-down activity requires justification.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="ID">
      <Value>PTO-PLN-005</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Responsible">
      <Value>E. Vidal</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Due" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="2" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="19719e11-cf16-5660-8f5e-973bc7801fb9" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">6. Supporting processes</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Configuration management: every work product of this project is under version control in SafeSuite (this project). Baselines are sealed and signed at the concept review and at release; the activity log is the tamper-evident record. Change management follows ISO 25119-4 Clause 11 — every modification request runs an impact analysis that decides the re-entry point (re-HARA when DC or MTTFd are touched).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="ID">
      <Value>PTO-PLN-006</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Responsible">
      <Value>E. Vidal</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Due" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="2" />
  </Item>
</StructuredDocument>
